1
00:00:00,798 --> 00:00:04,138
(Raj:)Mouthwash, lotion, body wash,
shampoo and conditioner...

2
00:00:04,301 --> 00:00:07,301
(Raj:)...together in one tiny bottle.

3
00:00:07,471 --> 00:00:09,301
(Raj:)I love Las Vegas.

4
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:12,730
Hey, Howard,
can I borrow some aftershave?

5
00:00:12,893 --> 00:00:14,473
(Howard:)Black case, top compartment.

6
00:00:20,567 --> 00:00:21,897
That's a lot of cologne.

7
00:00:22,069 --> 00:00:23,989
HOWARD:
First row are your musks.

8
00:00:24,154 --> 00:00:26,744
Second is woods, leathers and botanicals.

9
00:00:26,907 --> 00:00:30,957
(Howard:)Third is assorted pheromones.
Tread lightly.

10
00:00:37,126 --> 00:00:39,796
(Raj(finding a large quantity of condoms):)That's the spirit, Howard.

11
00:00:40,212 --> 00:00:42,842
(Raj(finding a large quantity of condoms):)Yes, we can.

12
00:00:45,384 --> 00:00:46,424
(Leonard:)Come on, let's go.

13
00:00:46,593 --> 00:00:49,633
(Howard:)You guys go ahead.
I just have to finish up an e-mail.

14
00:00:49,888 --> 00:00:53,178
(Leonard:)That's not an e-mail,
that's Leslie's Facebook page.

15
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:55,350
(Howard:)Okay, fine.
I'm checking her Facebook page.

16
00:00:55,519 --> 00:00:56,729
(Howard:)Look at her status update.

17
00:00:56,895 --> 00:01:00,025
(Howard:)She's saying she dumped me.
People need to know I dumped her.

